374 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 287 0 R
/E (Colon cancer starts when cells on the inside of the colon stop acting like normal cells. These cells grow and divide fast. This makes a lump of cancer cells called a tumor. Over time, the cancer can start to spread outside your colon to other parts of the body. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
