/P 290 0 R
/E (This is a test that uses a handheld device to get a picture of what is happening inside the body. This helps the doctor know if the cancer has spread. The person doing the test will put gel on part of your body to help get a better picture. This procedure is not painful.  )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
