454 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 290 0 R
/E (This is a test that uses a special camera to take a picture of the inside of your body. You will stand or lie still while a machine takes the picture. X-rays are often used to check your lungs. The test only takes a few minutes and does not hurt.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
455 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 290 0 R
/E (The CAT scan takes pictures of the inside of your body. This helps doctors see if the cancer has spread to other parts of your body. During the scan, you will lie still on a table that moves slowly through a large machine. The scan does not hurt, but you will have to be perfectly still while the pictures are being taken. It usually takes about 15 to 30 minutes. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
