459 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 291 0 R
/E (Surgery is usually the main treatment for colon cancer. The goal of surgery is to remove as much of the cancer from your body as possible. The way the doctor does this will depend on where the tumor is and how big it is. Your doctor will tell you how to prepare before surgery.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
460 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 291 0 R
/E (During surgery, a trained doctor called a surgeon will remove the part of the colon that has cancer. This is called a colectomy. You will be given medicine to make you sleep during the surgery so you do not feel pain. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
461 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 291 0 R
/E (After surgery, you will stay in the hospital for several days. Your care team will help you recover. They will discuss the different types of treatment that may take place after surgery, like physiotherapy, which will help you regain your movement and strength. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
462 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 291 0 R
/E (You will have a wound where the surgeon made the cut. Your care team will show you how to care for your wound at home. They will also tell you what foods are best to eat while your colon is recovering.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
