484 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 292 0 R
/E (The surgeon may also remove some of the lymph nodes around the cancer. Lymph nodes are small glands that are part of your immune system. Removing them helps the doctor check if the cancer has spread beyond the colon.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [12]
>>
