526 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 294 0 R
/E (You will receive chemotherapy in cycles. A cycle is one round of chemo. It has two parts: treatment days and rest days. Treatment days are when you receive chemotherapy. After treatment days, you will have some rest days or weeks to allow your body to recover. Then the cycle starts over again. Your doctor will let you know how many treatment days and rest days are in your cycle, and how many cycles you will have in total.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
