/K [9]
>>
endobj
528 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 294 0 R
/E (It is okay to have sexual relations during and after your colon cancer treatment. However, it is important to use family planning to prevent pregnancy and protect your partner. You may need to continue using contraception for several months after treatment. Talk with your healthcare team about the methods of family planning that are best for you. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
